# AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D (8 cores / 16 threads, one L3). Append this line to
# GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX, then reboot.
# Do not set CPUAffinity on reth-liq.service: the process must be able to
# pin onto the isolated cores. Lighthouse is the unit that is confined
# (ops/systemd/lighthouse.service).
#
# Logical CPU N and N+8 are the two threads of physical core N.
# Isolated:
#   0-2, 8-10   hot path (cores 0, 1, 2 pinned; siblings 8-10 left empty).
#   3, 4, 11, 12 sim workers (both threads of cores 3 and 4).
#   5, 13       router cache and submit (core 5 and its sibling).
# Left for Reth, Lighthouse, IRQs, CEX, telemetry, drift: 6, 7, 14, 15.
isolcpus=domain,managed_irq,0-5,8-13 nohz_full=0-5,8-13 rcu_nocbs=0-5,8-13 irqaffinity=6-7,14-15 processor.max_cstate=1 amd_idle.max_cstate=1
